<p class="kicker">A peer-to-peer alternative to the three-tier stack</p>
<h1>Letters, not servers.</h1>
<p class="lede">Souspli replaces pages a server renders for you with signed letters people send each other and keep. One file, complete and verifiable, opened in a container that cannot phone home.</p>
